DeepSeek Cloud Paper skin

The locally installed `deepseek-drool` Codex pet spritesheet was used as the
character and palette reference for the static mascot and ornament system.

A hand-drawn image supplied by the user was used only as a visual style
reference for irregular linework, flat color, paper grain, and natural fill
gaps. This notice does not claim or imply a license or redistribution right for
that reference image.

The final light and dark ornament artwork shipped in `assets/ornaments` was
generated with OpenAI ImageGen, then locally separated from its preview
background and encoded as transparent lossless WebP files. The local processing
did not redraw or replace the generated ornament designs.

This notice records the immediate development sources. It does not grant or
imply a license for third-party artwork, names, or marks depicted by them.
